WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:01.860
Everything...

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.020
I remember everything.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:12.720
I remember the entire mission
that was assigned to me.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.280
Mission?

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.270
The enemy that you must battle...

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.370
...is me!

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.480
Bruno!

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.990
It was you?

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.010
My name is Antinomy.

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:31.080
And the guardian of this Yusei 
Gear and the Ark Cradle.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.410
Duel Mode on.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.270
What's this?

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:42.550
This is a death course that's 
suited for your demise.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:43.430
Look!

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:49.830
What's that?

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.840
The loser will be swallowed
 into it and vanish!

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:53.730
What?

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:58.250
This duel doesn't end until 
one of us loses and vanishes.

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.700
You can't escape from this space!

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.840
Here we go, Yusei Fudo!

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:09.810
Duel!

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:40.640
The loser will be swallowed in flames.

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:43.080
The only way to escape is to win this duel!

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:45.750
I'll go first!

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:47.220
My turn!

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:50.950
I summon T.G. Catapult Dragon!

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:58.680
Due to this card's effect,
once per turn,

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:02.150
I can Special Summon a Level 3-or-below 
Tuner Monster from my hand.

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:05.610
I Special Summon T.G. Jet Falcon!

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:14.840
Level 3 Jet Falcon tunes 
Level 2 Catapult Dragon!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.940
Remove limiter level 5! Regulator open!

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:22.650
Thruster warmup OK! Uplink all clear!

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:30.590
Synchro Summon!
C'mon, T.G. Hyper Librarian!

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:37.060
When Jet Falcon is used to Synchro 
Summon, you take 500 points of damage.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:43.500
What?

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.060
That was close.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:54.750
Yusei!

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:57.720
If you're having trouble 
already, then you'll be

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:00.020
swallowed by the flames 
before this battle is over!

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:05.580
Riding Duels.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.710
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:15.310
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:23.310
Run! The road of evolution leading to tomorrow

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:27.850
Is a new legendary duel

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:44.810
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:50.430
Set free your infinite potential

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:56.040
Every beginning is up to you

00:03:56.040 --> 00:04:02.650
Everyone is lost Pursue the light

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:07.950
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:13.520
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:21.370
Become the gale and dance Cut through the darkness

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:26.570
Even if you can't see your destination

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:32.040
Run on your feet without fear

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:37.910
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:45.440
Going my way!! Break through and go!

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:04.810
Beginning of Demise
Battle for the Future!

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:10.460
I set one card and end my turn.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:15.910
Why do you hesitate?

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:19.720
You said that you'll defeat any
enemy that stands in your way!

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:21.690
Defeat a friend...

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.990
I told you!

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:26.190
If you don't fight and beat me,

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:29.400
you can't move ahead or save your friends!

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:36.420
No matter what you say, you can't change
how you feel about a former friend.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:39.770
That's your strength and 
your greatest weakness!

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:41.240
Bruno...

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.410
Show me how you duel!

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:48.680
Here I go!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.060
My turn!

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:57.580
I summon Junk Synchron!

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:07.870
When a Junk monster is on my field, I can 
Special Summon Junk Servant from my hand!

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:17.580
If he has a Synchro Monster on the 
field, he will definitely try to Accel Synchro.

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:19.550
So I'll destroy it beforehand!

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:24.280
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 4 Junk Servant!

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:28.330
The anger comes together to bring 
the spirit into the selfless warrior!

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:29.990
Become the path that lights the way!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:31.860
Synchro Summon!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.940
Roar, Junk Berserker!

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:40.700
Due to Hyper Librarian's effect,

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:44.240
when a Synchro Summon
occurs, I draw one card.

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:46.680
Junk Berserker's effect activates!

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:50.410
I remove one Junk monster 
in my graveyard from play

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:54.810
to lower your monster's attack points 
equal to its attack points!

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:58.220
Attack Hyper Librarian!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:03.720
Yusei, do you think that weak
strategy will work against me?

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:06.190
I activate the trap card Sonic Stun.

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:10.130
Your monster's attack is negated.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:13.960
He escaped the attack!

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:19.900
Sonic Stun also Special Summons a Level 
4-or-below Tuner Monster from my hand.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.540
I Special Summon T.G. Cyber Magician!

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:31.410
I set one card and end my turn.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:35.450
Your inner turmoil is putting
 the brakes on your dueling.

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:38.350
That means you'll never be able
to keep up with my dueling!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:39.260
What?

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:40.910
My turn!

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:45.340
I summon T.G. Rush Rhino!

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:54.150
Level 1 Cyber Magician 
tunes Level 4 Rush Rhino!

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:58.520
Limiter removal level 5! Booster launch OK!

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:02.660
Inclination OK! Grand support all clear!

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:05.910
Go, Synchro Summon!

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:09.620
C'mon, T.G. Wonder Magician!

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:12.120
The Synchro Tuner has arrived.

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.620
Due to Hyper Librarian's effect,

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:18.090
when a Synchro Summon
occurs, I draw one card.

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.360
Bruno!

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:33.940
Incredible.

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:36.270
Yusei, watch!

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:38.420
This is the real Clear Mind!

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:40.650
He's going to do it?

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:45.540
Level 5 Wonder Magician tunes 
Level 5 Hyper Librarian!

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.610
Limiter removal level 10!

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:52.560
Main bus booster control all clear!

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:57.400
Infinite power is now released 
and heads beyond dimensions!

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:00.490
Go, Accel Synchro!

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:03.830
C'mon, T.G. Blade Blaster!

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.670
Such vigor.

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.960
So this is his Accel Synchro.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:20.650
Why did you teach me how to Accel Synchro?

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:26.360
If I didn't, you would 
never have won the WRGP.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:32.330
And in your battle against Aporia,
that power called forth Ark Cradle.

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:35.300
Yusei, your role is finished.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:38.770
What? Are you serious?

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:45.040
Blade Blaster attacks Junk Berserker!

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.510
Shoot Blade!

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:59.200
When a Synchro Monster is destroyed, 
I can Special Summon this card from my hand.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.960
I summon T.G. Metal Skeleton!

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:05.700
Metal Skeleton attacks you directly!

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:15.670
I set one card and end my turn.

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:17.640
Yusei!

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:19.720
Your heart is disturbed.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:22.280
In your current state, you'll 
not only fail to beat me,

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:23.610
but you can't beat Z-one either!

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:25.350
Z-one?

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:28.020
Bruno!

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.360
Who is Z-one?

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:33.490
Z-one is trying to change 
the future from destruction.

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:40.220
In the destroyed world, I met Z-one.

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:45.930
In the future, I was on the circuit 
as a professional D-Wheeler.

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:51.980
Just like you, I wanted everyone 
to know how great dueling was.

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:55.880
I never questioned that
it gave people hope and dreams.

00:10:58.750 --> 00:10:59.670
However...

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:01.920
Why?

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:03.950
Why can't I use Synchros?

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:09.920
Synchros can trigger wars 
 around the world at any moment!

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:12.930
We can't use Synchros
irresponsibly at this crucial time!

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:17.900
So isn't now the time to show 
how to use Synchros properly?

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:22.410
Just like how in the past, the legendary 
duelist known as Yusei Fudo

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.990
used Synchros to give people 
hope all around the world!

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:26.140
But...

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:27.580
Big trouble!

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:28.760
What is it?

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:33.150
Due to Synchros and Moment, 
the network is going out of control!

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:34.050
What?

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:37.270
If that's true, then it's big trouble!

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:47.000
On that day, the world suddenly 
headed on the path of destruction.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:59.570
Why did this happen?

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:03.740
Was I wrong to use Synchros?

00:12:04.150 --> 00:12:05.180
It can't be...

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.110
No way!

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:48.980
No way!

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:11.310
It was Z-one.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:13.780
Z-one saved me.

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:18.440
Despite all the hopelessness, Z-one 
kept battling, still holding on to hope.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:19.900
I felt ashamed.

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:27.580
Us four survivors began experiments 
to save the destroyed world.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.380
The rest is just as Aporia explained.

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:37.370
After spending a lot of time on those 
experiments, we passed away.

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:44.170
In order to save this 
world, I need your power.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:50.550
Z-one, you must someday save the world.

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:55.820
To make that come true,
I will be your servant.

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:04.830
Other than Z-one, my friends 
died. But like myself,

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:07.720
they resurrected as Z-one's servants 
for the sake of the future.

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:11.770
Can it be that Z-one is...

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:12.970
That's right.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:15.240
Z-one is the last human alive!

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:17.210
No way!

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:19.880
Due to Aporia's three despairs,

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:24.070
he resurrected with three personalities 
and controlled Iliaster.

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:29.820
My mission was to protect 
you and have you grow up.

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:33.940
But I'm surprised that 
you've evolved this much.

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:38.160
And to think that I 
now have to crush you.

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:42.630
So I'm nothing more
than a cog in a wheel?

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:47.040
Ark Cradle has already appeared.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.690
Neo Domino City is certain
to be destroyed.

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:51.900
There will definitely be a new future.

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:56.410
I can't allow you to stop those plans!

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.960
How selfish!

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:03.150
You not only tricked me, but also 5D's!
And you're sacrificing the world!

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:06.480
Do you really think there's
hope for this future?

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:09.160
Answer me! Well?

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:13.760
Just as you 5D's are 
connected by a strong bond,

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:18.410
me, Z-one and my friends formed 
a strong bond through despair.

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.900
My promise to Z-one is my mission!

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:24.370
So that's what you must do, Bruno?

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.840
I'm Antinomy.

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:32.490
In that case, for me and my
friends' futures, I'll defeat you!

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:35.320
Bruno, I mean, Antinomy!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.250
My turn!

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:44.460
I activate Speed Spell - 
Angel Baton from my hand!

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:47.900
When I have two or more Speed Counters,

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:51.820
I draw two cards, and I send 
one card in my hand to the graveyard!

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:54.770
I Special Summon Unknown Synchron!

00:15:55.170 --> 00:16:00.470
I can Special Summon it when 
you're the only one who has monsters!

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:06.480
I tribute Unknown Synchron to 
Tribute Summon Level 5 Salvage Warrior!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:10.800
When this card is successfully 
Tribute Summoned,

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:15.180
I can Special Summon one Tuner Monster
from my graveyard or my hand!

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.290
I Special Summon Junk Synchron!

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:23.900
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 5 Salvage Warrior!

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:28.800
The wishes come together to 
form a new shining star!

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:30.270
Become the path that lights the way!

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:31.470
Synchro Summon!

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.940
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:44.420
You finally summoned Stardust Dragon.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:47.500
When Stardust Dragon is 
successfully summoned,

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:51.370
I can Special Summon Stardust 
Xiaolong from my graveyard!

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.070
I activate the trap Graceful Revival!

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:59.160
I Special Summon a Level 2-or-below 
monster from my graveyard!

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:02.060
Resurrect, Unknown Synchron!

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:07.600
Level 1 Unknown Synchron tunes 
Level 1 Stardust Xiaolong!

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:12.270
The wishes come together to 
invite a new world of speed!

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:13.880
Become the path that lights the way!

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:15.750
Synchro Summon!

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:19.920
The Synchro Tuner with the power
of hope! Formula Synchron!

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:21.650
You're going to Accel Synchro.

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:25.290
I activate Formula Synchron's effect!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:28.420
Once per turn, I draw one card from my deck.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:31.120
I will no longer be indecisive.

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:35.300
In order to protect my 
friends, this is my answer!

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:37.260
I

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.710
Clear Mind!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:45.040
Level 2 Formula Synchron tunes 
Level 8 Stardust Dragon!

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:53.310
Dreams crystallize to open
a new door of evolution!

00:17:53.310 --> 00:17:55.080
Become the path that lights the way!

00:17:57.920 --> 00:18:00.120
Accel Synchro!

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:07.700
Arise!

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:10.410
Shooting Star Dragon!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:19.670
You're now dueling seriously, Yusei.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:23.440
Antinomy, I will overcome 
my limits and battle!

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:24.450
What?

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:28.420
Shooting Star Dragon attacks 
Metal Skeleton!

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:47.030
I set one card and end my turn.

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:51.480
You're trying to overcome your limits,

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:54.510
but all you did was 
get on equal par with me.

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:59.750
Too bad, but what you think is
 the limit isn't the actual limit.

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:01.210
What do you mean?

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:06.950
Accel Synchro isn't the end.
It's nothing more than a waypoint!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.150
What?

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:12.890
I'll show you what's far beyond 
your knowledge!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.330
My turn!

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:21.320
I can Special Summon this card 
by lowering the attack points

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:24.800
of one of my Machine-Type
monsters by 1000!

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:27.900
I Special Summon T.G. Gear Zombie!

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:39.830
Then I summon T.G. Drill Fish!

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:48.390
Level 1 Gear Zombie tunes Level 1 Drill Fish!

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:52.740
Limiter removal level 2!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.490
Regulator open!

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:58.370
Navigation all clear!

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:00.340
Go, Synchro Summon!

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:04.310
C'mon, T.G. Recipro Dragonfly!

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:07.150
Due to Recipro Dragonfly's effect,

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:10.040
I return one Synchro 
Monster to the Extra Deck

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.880
to resurrect two monsters from the graveyard
that were used to Synchro Summon it.

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:18.660
Resurrect, Wonder Magician 
and Hyper Librarian!

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:24.590
You returned an Accel Synchro 
Monster to the Extra Deck?

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:28.890
This is what's beyond Accel Synchro!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.240
What are you planning to do?

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:35.470
The stage that breaks boundaries!

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:37.170
Top Clear Mind!

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:44.210
What?

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:45.980
Yusei, observe!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:50.590
Level 5 Wonder Magician tunes 
Level 2 T.G. Recipro Dragonfly

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:53.020
and Level 5 Hyper Librarian!

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:58.200
Limiter removal level max!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.470
Regulator open!

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:00.330
All clear!

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:05.300
Infinite power, break through time 
and space to open the unknown world!

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:07.300
Go, Delta Accel!

00:21:15.140 --> 00:21:16.180
C'mon!

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:19.770
T.G. Halberd Cannon!

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:29.080
What's this?

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:29.900
Yusei!

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:31.660
See that?

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:34.860
I Synchro Summoned using three Synchro Monsters.

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:37.400
This is the Synchro beyond Accel Synchro!

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:41.370
It's Delta Accel Synchro!

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:43.840
Delta Accel Synchro?

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:11.730
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.980 --> 00:22:17.100
If we shed the same tears, let's laugh together

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:22.480
Freed reality forms phrases in the piercing beat

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:25.260
Our hearts resonate

00:22:25.260 --> 00:22:30.450
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:37.070
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:44.160
Waking in a dream Stretch our hands toward the future

00:22:44.160 --> 00:22:49.210
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:55.390
